--- diagnostics ---
SC0417 @38..54 `H5R_ref_t` needs its size and its alignment
  note a C union is imported as an opaque blob of the right size and alignment, because its layout is the C ABI's and nothing in Science may read its arms
  note take both numbers from `sizeof` and `alignof` on the target, or from what `sciencec bindgen` recorded; the library's own accessors bind as ordinary `function` items
